     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;m using leaflet with shiny and trying to add a webpage in the popup using an iframe tag.  It works fine locally but does not work on the web.  Any ideas on how to make this work.  The relevent bit of code is below:<div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>addPolygons</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">MadisonSwanson</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fillOpacity</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stroke</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>            fillColor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;#66c2a5&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>            popup</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&lt;a&gt;&lt;b&gt;Madison and Swanson&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                           </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Seasonal area closures implemented to protect Gulf reef fish&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                           </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;&lt;a href=&quot;<a href=\"http://sero.nmfs.noaa.gov/maps_gis_data/fisheries/gom/documents/madswan_steam_edges.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sero.nmfs.noaa.gov/maps_gis_data/fisheries/gom/documents/madswan_steam_edges.txt&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395791146000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0oNLDAwFwJzxyBCmxWljXM\">http://sero.nmfs.noaa.gov/maps_gis_data/fisheries/gom/documents/madswan_steam_edges.txt</a>&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Federal regulations&lt;/a&gt;&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                           </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;&lt;iframe src=&quot;<a href=\"http://sero.nmfs.noaa.gov/maps_gis_data/fisheries/gom/documents/madswan_steam_edges.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sero.nmfs.noaa.gov/maps_gis_data/fisheries/gom/documents/madswan_steam_edges.txt&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395791146000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0oNLDAwFwJzxyBCmxWljXM\">http://sero.nmfs.noaa.gov/maps_gis_data/fisheries/gom/documents/madswan_steam_edges.txt</a>&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                           sep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&lt;br/&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Madison and Swanson&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div></code></div><div><div><br></div></div><div>The app can be viewed here: <a href=\"https://gulfcouncilportal.shinyapps.io/reeffishmanagementareas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gulfcouncilportal.shinyapps.io/reeffishmanagementareas&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395791146000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0W4hoXwOxrPPSNg7VKk3Z3\">https://gulfcouncilportal.shinyapps.io/reeffishmanagementareas</a>.  Ideally, the page here: <a href=\"http://sero.nmfs.noaa.gov/maps_gis_data/fisheries/gom/documents/madswan_steam_edges.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sero.nmfs.noaa.gov/maps_gis_data/fisheries/gom/documents/madswan_steam_edges.txt&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395791146000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0oNLDAwFwJzxyBCmxWljXM\">http://sero.nmfs.noaa.gov/maps_gis_data/fisheries/gom/documents/madswan_steam_edges.txt</a> would display in the popup using something like this </div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;&lt;iframe src=&quot;<a href=\"http://sero.nmfs.noaa.gov/maps_gis_data/fisheries/gom/documents/madswan_steam_edges.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sero.nmfs.noaa.gov/maps_gis_data/fisheries/gom/documents/madswan_steam_edges.txt&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395791146000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0oNLDAwFwJzxyBCmxWljXM\">http://sero.nmfs.noaa.gov/maps_gis_data/fisheries/gom/documents/madswan_steam_edges.txt</a>&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#39;</span></div></code></div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;color:rgb(0,136,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span>Any help greatly appreciated.</div></div>"
